Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), pkg-config, postgresql-server-dev-18, libgraphblas-dev (>= 10.5.2), liblagraph-dev (>= 1.2.2)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/OneSparse/OneSparse

Package: postgresql-18-onesparse
Architecture: any
Depends: postgresql-18, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sparse linear algebra and graph extension for PostgreSQL 18
 OneSparse exposes sparse vectors, matrices, and graph algorithms backed by
 SuiteSparse GraphBLAS and LAGraph for PostgreSQL 18.
 Add onesparse to shared_preload_libraries and restart PostgreSQL before
 creating the extension.
